commit 6fa902624f14e927ea66950a310d5c00e14e1381

C03: a greeting with another name says the name is BAXY, a reassurance gets a brief acknowledgement, visual content is an honest boundary (CONVERSATION1343)

CONVERSATION1150/1152 left three literals open. «hola Carter»: the reply greeted without saying who answers; a misnamed_greeting presentation shape greets back and says the name is BAXY (contract: names BAXY, never claims the other name). «NO te preocupes si se abrio steam»: the reply asked or contradicted itself; a reassurance_ack shape answers with one short acknowledgement, no question and no claim about the PC. «Tienes algun meme?»: the reply promised a meme it cannot show; a request for memes, images, photos or gifs is classified as an unsupported conversation and answered as a boundary of this PC.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


